{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"实现篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"module-federation","title":"Module Federation 2.0 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/module-federation","wordCount":773,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"single-spa-framework","title":"Single-SPA 与运行时编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/single-spa-framework","wordCount":841,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"web-components-approach","title":"Web Components 与边缘组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/web-components-approach","wordCount":845,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实现篇导读\">实现篇导读</h1><p>本章深入三条主流技术路线的实战细节。Module Federation 2.0 代表「构建时联邦」的最新形态；Single-SPA 代表「运行时编排」的标准路径；Web Components 与边缘组合则代表「浏览器原生 + 基础设施组合」的去框架化方向。三者并非互斥——大型系统中往往混合使用。阅读时建议横向对比各方案在类型安全、共享策略、部署独立性维度的取舍。</p>\n"}